{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.214, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:21.611Z", "t_ms": 6212, "delta": "ReWOO uses specialization to make a small model plan well through the following approach"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.393, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:21.790Z", "t_ms": 6391, "delta": ":\n\n* **Decoupling Reasoning from Observations:** ReWOO separates the reasoning process from tool calls and their subsequent observations [C1,"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.735, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:22.131Z", "t_ms": 6732, "delta": " C2]. Because the Planner module is not exposed to tool responses during training, it can be optimized purely for the generic capability"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.876, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:22.273Z", "t_ms": 6874, "delta": " of \"foreseeable reasoning\" rather than learning full thought-action-observation trajectories [C2].\n* **Distilling"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.119, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:22.516Z", "t_ms": 7117, "delta": " via Bootstrapped Instruction Data:** The authors elicit foreseeable reasoning traces from a large model (175B `text-davinci-0"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.291, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:22.687Z", "t_ms": 7288, "delta": "03` / GPT-3.5) by generating 4,000 plan blueprints on training data from HotpotQA and"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.465, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:22.861Z", "t_ms": 7462, "delta": " TriviaQA [C1, C2]. Using a bootstrapping technique, they filter down to approximately 2,000"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.763, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:23.159Z", "t_ms": 7760, "delta": " successful blueprints that lead to correct answers [C2].\n* **Two-Stage Fine-Tuning Pipeline:**\n"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.95, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 35, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:23.347Z", "t_ms": 7948, "delta": "  1. A pretrained LLaMA-7B is instruction fine-tuned on a 52k self-instruct"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.087, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 36, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:23.484Z", "t_ms": 8085, "delta": " dataset to produce Alpaca-7B, giving it general reasoning capabilities [C2].\n  2. Alpaca-7B"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.245, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 37, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:23.642Z", "t_ms": 8243, "delta": " is further fine-tuned using Low-Rank Adaptation (LoRA) on the 2,000 Planner instruction blueprints"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.571, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 38, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:23.968Z", "t_ms": 8569, "delta": " to create **Planner 7B**, a model specialized in generating multi-step execution plans [C2, C4].\n* **Performance"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.742, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 39, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:24.138Z", "t_ms": 8739, "delta": " and Generalization:** When deployed as the Planner module, the specialized 7B model matches the performance of the $25\\"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.942, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 40, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:24.339Z", "t_ms": 8940, "delta": "times$ larger GPT-3.5 across benchmarks like HotpotQA, TriviaQA, and StrategyQA [C3]. Special"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.14, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 41, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:24.537Z", "t_ms": 9137, "delta": "ization also improves generalization to unseen tools: despite only being trained on `Wikipedia` and `LLM` tool calls, Planner 7B"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.292, "data": {"request_id": "b011303cc3ab", "seq": 42, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:01:24.688Z", "t_ms": 9289, "delta": " effectively reasons with tools like `Google` and `Calculator` when paired with in-context descriptions [C3]."}}
